; Under --budget a balance report chains budget_posts and no forecast_posts
; (chain_pre_post_handlers takes the forecast branch only without --budget),
; so --forecast-while is evaluated there only by the forecast-while
; filter_posts of chain_post_handlers.  Accounts reports no longer install
; that filter, so the budget balance is the plain one and an invalid
; predicate (the bare word Food) goes unreported.  reg --budget still
; evaluates the predicate on every posting.

2030/07/01 Landlord
    Expenses:Rent    $500.00
    Assets:Cash

~ Monthly from 2030/06/01
    Expenses:Rent    $500.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal --budget --forecast-while Food --now 2030/08/15
            $1000.00  Assets:Cash
           $-1000.00  Expenses:Rent
--------------------
                   0
end test
